---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base lang="zh" title="隐私 | Open JXL" description="文件只在当前设备内存中处理。" path="/zh/privacy/">
<section class="page-hero">
<span class="eyebrow">隐私</span>
<h1>你的文件<span class="grad">从不离开本机</span></h1>
<p class="lead">文件只在当前设备内存中处理，关闭或刷新即丢弃。</p>
</section>

<section class="check-grid">
<div class="card check-card"><span class="check">✓</span><div><strong>不上传图像</strong><p>解码只在浏览器本地进行，没有接收文件的服务器接口。</p></div></div>
<div class="card check-card"><span class="check">✓</span><div><strong>只有匿名统计</strong><p>只统计预览、导出与检测结果数量，不记录文件名与内容。</p></div></div>
<div class="card check-card"><span class="check">✓</span><div><strong>无广告 Cookie</strong><p>无广告追踪，统计无 Cookie。</p></div></div>
<div class="card check-card"><span class="check">@</span><div><strong>联系方式</strong><p>对隐私有疑问？请联系 hello@example.com。</p></div></div>
</section>
</Base>
